# Stakeholders
## Volunteers - role: volunteering for events and activities - direct user: yes: needs/cares - The volunteer needs to know what event/activity the are attending to help.
## Organisers - role: helping organise events and activities - direct user: yes: needs/cares - organisers need to know who is available.
## Event Manager - role: main organiser of events - direct user: yes - needs/cares: The event manager cares about having the right volunteers with the best experience and skills.
## Activity Manager - role: main organiser of Activites - direct user: yes - needs/cares: The activities manager cares about having the right volunteers with the best experience and skills
## Director of the organisation - role: The main person running the organisation - direct user: no - needs/cares: the make the system fully functional and cost-effective.
## Sign up Manager - role: sorts out all sign up applications for the organisation - direct user: yes - needs/cares: they need to have all sign ups in one location as to not cause confusion.
